+// SCROLL USED DIRECTLY ON A PARROT — INSTANT CROW CONVERSION
+// Interacting with a parrot while holding a scroll transforms it
+// into a messenger crow immediately, without having to throw the
+// scroll on the ground. The legacy thrown-scroll flow below still
